 230++1400 01 FF FF                     LD BC, (FT_CMD_SPINNER >> 16) & 0xFFFF
 231++1403 CD EB 13                     CALL Command_BCDE
 232++1406
 233++1406 D1                           POP DE
 234++1407 C1                           POP BC
 235++1408 CD EB 13                     CALL Command_BCDE
 236++140B
