1973  328F              ; FormatScore24ToBuf — DrawNumBuf = decimal of VDC_PlayerScore (up to 8 digits,
1974  328F              ; leading zeros blanked to spaces, which render at zero width). Clobbers all.
1975  328F              ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
1976  328F              FormatScore24ToBuf:
1977  328F 2A DD 6A                     LD   HL, (Core.VDC_PlayerScore)
1978  3292 22 30 33                     LD   (Score24Work), HL
1979  3295 3A DF 6A                     LD   A, (Core.VDC_PlayerScore + 2)
