4483  6A5D              ; Pause "No"/resume fade-out: VDC_DialogState=4 holds the board frozen (not-Play,
4484  6A5D              ; so frog can't shoot and game time stays frozen) while the pause window fades
4485  6A5D              ; out over PAUSE_FADE_FRAMES ticks; then -> PLAY. VDC_PauseAlpha (255=opaque)
4486  6A5D              ; scales the whole window's draw alpha during the fade.
4487  6A5D              PAUSE_FADE_FRAMES EQU 74        ; ~1 s at 74 Hz vsync
4488  6A5D 00           PauseFadeTimer:    DEFB 0
4489  6A5E FF           VDC_PauseAlpha:    DEFB 255
