  84+ 6ACB              ; Adventure state vars (CurrentLevel etc) previously lived in TSLib region
  85+ 6ACB              ; #1937 area where TSLib activity corrupted them. Resident in Core so gameplay,
  86+ 6ACB              ; menu and level-select code reach them while the loader overlay is unmapped.
  87+ 6ACB 00           FadeAlpha:         DEFB 0
  88+ 6ACC 00           CurrentDifficulty: DEFB 0
  89+ 6ACD 00           CurrentLevel:      DEFB 0
  90+ 6ACE 06           VDC_ActiveTrackPage1: DEFB TRACK_L01_PAGE
  91+ 6ACF 0F           VDC_ActiveTrackPage2: DEFB TRACK_PAGE2
