   3+ 73BC              ; These routines/tables/vars are used by BOTH gameplay (overlay #04) AND the
   4+ 73BC              ; level-select preview render (overlay #41). After the main1_play overlay split
   5+ 73BC              ; they MUST be resident (slot 1, always mapped) so either scene can call them
