 539+ C352 32 51 D4                     LD   (VDC_KzCloseTick), A
 540+ C355 C9                           RET
 541+ C356              .upd_closing:   ; анимация KzFrame 11→1 за 22 ticks (2 tick/frame), затем PLAY.
