 710+ C484              VDC_UpdateSfxStopTimer:
 711+ C484 3A 67 D4                     LD   A, (VDC_SfxStopTimer)
 712+ C487 B7                           OR   A
 713+ C488 C8                           RET  Z
 714+ C489 3D                           DEC  A
 715+ C48A 32 67 D4                     LD   (VDC_SfxStopTimer), A
 716+ C48D C0                           RET  NZ
 717+ C48E 3E 26                        LD   A, SND_SILENCE
 718+ C490 C3 3C 6C                     JP   GS_PlaySfx
