 332+ DFA7              ;   Out: A = signed result (-8..+8 px)
 333+ DFA7              ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 334+ DFA7              Frog_SignedScale_div2048:
 335+ DFA7 78                             LD   A, B
 336+ DFA8 1E 00                          LD   E, 0
 337+ DFAA CB 7F                          BIT  7, A
