 366+ EC88                              ; --- VDC chain rendering: per-ball tangent + grouped matrix emit.
 367+ EC88                              ; Algorithm:
 368+ EC88                              ;   Pre-pass: cache stable tangent, cell, Vx, Vy for each ball.
 369+ EC88                              ;   Draw: quantize tangent to 8 BRAD and emit matrix only when it
 370+ EC88                              ;   differs from the previous visible ball. This keeps per-slot
 371+ EC88                              ;   tangent stability without the old bucket segment flicker.
 372+ EC88 0E FF                        LD   C, 255
 372+ EC8A 16 FF          LD D, 255
 372+ EC8C 1E FF          LD E, 255
