1258+ F35B              ; ZL_ChainMatrixLUT — pre-baked rotation matrices для 32 buckets (8 BRAD step).
1259+ F35B              ; Каждый bucket = 24 байта = 6 BITMAP_TRANSFORM_A..F opcodes. Sgnerированы
1260+ F35B              ; make_chain_matrix_lut.py (Q8.8 cos/sin, Q23.8 translation centered at +16/-16).
1261+ F35B              ; Bypass FT812 coprocessor — LDIR прямо в CMD буфер.
