4526  D9C3                              ; ----- loader overlay (slot 3, page LOADER_OVL_PAGE) — RawPak FAT
4527  D9C3                              ; loader, mapped into slot 3 only during a level/preview load.
4528  D9C3                              ; Shares the #C000 window with the other overlays (different page),
4529  D9C3                              ; never co-resident. Reached via the trampolines in loader_resident.asm.
