1128+ CB9F              ; Read the partition BPB (sector at RawPak_PartLba) into the buffer and check it
1129+ CB9F              ; looks like FAT32 (bytes/sector == 512). Used to probe SD block-vs-byte
1130+ CB9F              ; addressing. Out: CF=0 valid BPB; CF=1 read error or not a 512-byte-sector BPB.
